<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ OUT FOR 201 VS SRI LANKA IN ONE DAYER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ OUT FOR 201 VS SRI LANKA IN ONE DAYER.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were all out for 201 after 49.2 overs against Sri Lanka in the second and final one day match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand 201 (C.Cairns 56, C.Vaas 4-26).</p>
